# Tracker's Rise (CIPlay trackers_rise): the meadow round 0 4, the tower at -14 -12, the gully round 24 24 with Burr's
# cage and the satchel, the anchor box -6 -14, the llamas round -6 14, Ranger log 5 at 2 -4.
island Tracker's Rise
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 17.7 -7.6; the points below are in the old frame
offset -17.7 7.6
expect step 0
expect title Tracks
zone meadow
expect step 1
read Tracking guide
expect step 2
open Tower chest
wait 3
expect step 3
zone gully
expect step 4
use burrcage
